    "name": "luh-monte-carlo-simulations-of-atomic-clocks",
    "notes": "To validate theoretical predictions on clock stability and to assess the robustness of Ramsey schemes in realistic scenarios, we performed comprehensive numerical Monte Carlo simulations of the full feedback loop in an atomic clock throughout recent publications. Here, we provide a brief overview of the methods used to simulate an atomic clock.\r\n\r\nInstructions on how to run the code can be found in the ReadMe.md file.",
